{"html": "<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 11 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">物理约束重建：从后处理到展开优化与测量一致性</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Physics-Informed Recon</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_118_learn-title\">LEARN</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">LEARN 每个展开阶段并行计算 CT 数据梯度和 learned experts CNN 正则梯度，再做残差更新。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Unrolls K iterative sparse-view CT reconstruction stages where each stage combines an explicit projection residual gradient A^T(Ax^t − y) with a stage-specific 3-layer CNN regularizer.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">稀疏视角 CT 投影 y、系统矩阵 A/Aᵀ 和初始图像 x0</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Sparse-view CT sinogram y, system projection matrix A / backprojection A^T, and initial image x^0</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">固定阶段后的 CT 重建 xN</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Reconstructed CT image x^K after K≈50 unrolled expert stages</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 2 · PDF p.Official PMC Figure 2 full-size asset</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始架构图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC6019143/\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" onclick=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_118_learn')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" onclick=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_118_learn')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"LEARN original paper architecture figure, Figure 2\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/c5a98d44bf952c4506de.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 2 · PDF p.Official PMC Figure 2 full-size asset</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 8 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" onclick=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_118_learn', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_118_learn\" onclick=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_118_learn')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" onclick=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_118_learn', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_118_learn\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 08 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">稀疏投影 y</span><span class=\"lang-en\">projection y</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">校准与对数变换后的 CT measurement</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests sparse-view ct sinogram y, system projection matrix a / backprojection a^t, and initial image x^0 and prepares initial tensor representations (projection y).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"校准与对数变换后的 CT measurement\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests sparse-view ct sinogram y, system projection matrix a / backprojection a^t, and initial image x^0 and prepares initial tensor representations (projection y).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"稀疏投影 y\" data-node-name-en=\"projection y\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_118_learn', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">稀疏投影 y</span><span class=\"lang-en\">projection y</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">校准与对数变换后的 CT measurement</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests sparse-view ct sinogram y, system projection matrix a / backprojection a^t, and initial image x^0 and prepares initial tensor representations (projection y).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"前向投影和反投影显式进入每一阶段\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes A Aᵀ to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"A 与 Aᵀ\" data-node-name-en=\"A Aᵀ\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_118_learn', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">A 与 Aᵀ</span><span class=\"lang-en\">A Aᵀ</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">前向投影和反投影显式进入每一阶段</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes A Aᵀ to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"可为零、FBP 或传统迭代结果\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs reconstruction x0 within the core unrolled ct gradient expert cascade computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"初始重建 x0\" data-node-name-en=\"reconstruction x0\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_118_learn', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">初始重建 x0</span><span class=\"lang-en\">reconstruction x0</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">可为零、FBP 或传统迭代结果</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs reconstruction x0 within the core unrolled ct gradient expert cascade computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"每阶段计算 λt Aᵀ(Axt−y)\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Data Consistency Gradient within the core unrolled ct gradient expert cascade computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"数据保真梯度\" data-node-name-en=\"Data Consistency Gradient\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_118_learn', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">数据保真梯度</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Data Consistency Gradient</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">每阶段计算 λt Aᵀ(Axt−y)</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Data Consistency Gradient within the core unrolled ct gradient expert cascade computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"学习 fields-of-experts 正则梯度，卷积核与非线性随阶段变化\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs 3-layer CNN within the core unrolled ct gradient expert cascade computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"阶段特异 3-layer CNN\" data-node-name-en=\"3-layer CNN\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_118_learn', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">阶段特异 3-layer CNN</span><span class=\"lang-en\">3-layer CNN</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">学习 fields-of-experts 正则梯度，卷积核与非线性随阶段变化</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs 3-layer CNN within the core unrolled ct gradient expert cascade computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"当前图像减去数据梯度和 learned regularizer 得到下一阶段\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs residual iterative update within the core unrolled ct gradient expert cascade computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"残差迭代更新\" data-node-name-en=\"residual iterative update\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_118_learn', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">残差迭代更新</span><span class=\"lang-en\">residual iterative update</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">当前图像减去数据梯度和 learned regularizer 得到下一阶段</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs residual iterative update within the core unrolled ct gradient expert cascade computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"投影输入与高质量 CT 成对监督所有展开参数\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies reconstruction loss to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"端到端重建损失\" data-node-name-en=\"reconstruction loss\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_118_learn', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">端到端重建损失</span><span class=\"lang-en\">reconstruction loss</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">投影输入与高质量 CT 成对监督所有展开参数</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies reconstruction loss to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"固定 N 个阶段后的最终 CT\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces reconstructed ct image x^k after k≈50 unrolled expert stages via xN reconstruction.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"xN 重建\" data-node-name-en=\"xN reconstruction\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_118_learn', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">xN 重建</span><span class=\"lang-en\">xN reconstruction</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">固定 N 个阶段后的最终 CT</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces reconstructed ct image x^k after k≈50 unrolled expert stages via xN reconstruction.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"LEARN Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · 数据一致性与阶段特异 CNN 正则梯度的展开更新</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Unrolled Iterative CT Gradient Descent with Stage-Specific Learned Expert Regularizers</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"LEARN：核心公式 · 数据一致性与阶段特异 CNN 正则梯度的展开更新\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"118\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"12.247708pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-69.279199 -69.000129 238.012958 12.247708\" width=\"238.012958pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><path d=\"M4.158951-1.659233V-2.064984H.449225V-1.659233H4.158951Z\" id=\"m118_g7-0\"></path><path d=\"M4.709614-3.579306V-3.985058H.449225V-3.579306H2.376544V0H2.782295V-3.579306H4.709614